      "extract": "Unitary representations of $E_q(2)$ are previously studied [@5]. We now show that the matrix elements of the unitary irreducible representations of $E_q(2)$ can be obtained from the ones of $SU_q(2)$ by contraction. This example shows that there exists q--analog of contraction procedure of classical groups representations which was investigated in [@6]. In Appendix C we review the derivation of the matrix elements",
